{"tweets":[{"type":"tweet","id":"2106436619104362675","url":"https://x.com/BaseHubHB/status/2106436619104362675","twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/BaseHubHB/status/2106436619104362675","text":"📄 Base Weekly Recap\n\nWhat happened on @base this week\n\nNEWS\n\n■ @base selected 10 teams from 750+ Base Batches 004 applications.\n\n■ Base Cobalt went live with Validity Transactions and B20 enhancements.\n\n■ @Coinbase Tokenized Stocks reached a new ATH with $100M in daily Base volume.\n\n■ @coinbase and Citi are bringing stablecoin payments to regulated rails on Base.\n\nSTATS\n\n■ @Aave V4 stock-backed loans on Base reached $9M in deposits.\n\n■ @OpenGradient crossed 842K private inferences and 8.7B processed tokens.\n\n■ @KorProtocol crossed 100K KOR ID mints on Base.\n\n■ @aeroxyz passed $1B in tokenized-stock volume in one month.\n\n■ @bankrbot reached 21.6B $BNKR staked, with $50.8K streaming to stakers.\n\n■ @Stonks_Exchange creators earned $300K in trading fees.\n\n■ @feeldotcash is adding 15 tokenized stocks, with 25% of revenue going to base:0xa6af0cea8fbc93e1eccc00f1fdd9a0bba251fee1 buybacks.\n\nLAUNCHES\n\n■ @Cloudflare brought its Monetization Gateway to Base for USDC agent payments.\n\n■ @catalystmkts_ launched event markets for social activity, listings, launches, news, and onchain events.\n\n■ @numoforex launched the first USDC-cNGN perpetual on Base.\n\n■ @rifthq launched an execution API for swaps, bridges, and deposits.\n\n■ @morpho added P2P Orders with custom terms and fixed-rate settlement.\n\n■ @avantprotocol launched productive-capital markets through Morpho.\n\n■ @verantaxyz added 39 assets on Base, including 26 new onchain names.\n\n■ @jumperapp launched carry-trade vaults for METAc, NVDAc, GOOGLc, and AAPLc.\n\n■ @predofficial launched NBA preseason markets with zero fees.\n\n■ @fluidkey launched auto-earn, routing incoming USDC into a Morpho vault.\n\n■ @forevermoney_ai brought TAO and subnet tokens to Base through Chainlink CCIP.\n\n■ @hydrexfi launched Hydropump for creating and trading new tokens.\n\nAI & BUILDERS\n\n■ @aeonframework added Arc Studio support for full-stack agent apps across nine chains.\n\n■ @usedotai committed more than $160K to its private inference infrastructure.\n\n■ @openservai brought ShinyThings’ AI gaming worlds to the SERV Launchpad.\n\n■ @dominationfi moved from open beta to invite-only access with more pairs coming.\n\n■ @iPodAAPLc reached around $1M, with holders earning $AAPLC.\n\n■ @MeatMETAc published its $MEAT and Meta memestock thesis.","source":"Twitter for iPhone","retweetCount":8,"replyCount":13,"likeCount":84,"quoteCount":2,"viewCount":3415,"createdAt":"Sat Oct 03 17:30:00 +0000 2026","lang":"en","bookmarkCount":4,"isReply":false,"inReplyToId":null,"conversationId":"2106436619104362675","displayTextRange":[0,274],"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"author":{"type":"user","userName":"BaseHubHB","url":"https://x.com/BaseHubHB","twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/BaseHubHB","id":"1685997752969564160","name":"Base Hub 🛡️","isVerified":false,"isBlueVerified":true,"verifiedType":null,"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1709447445523181568/NubPOLH5_normal.jpg","coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1685997752969564160/1712072604","description":"","location":"No affiliation with Base","followers":57936,"following":28,"status":"","canDm":true,"canMediaTag":true,"createdAt":"Mon Jul 31 12:56:30 +0000 2023","entities":{"description":{"urls":[]},"url":{}},"fastFollowersCount":0,"favouritesCount":45763,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"isTranslator":false,"mediaCount":4409,"statusesCount":11262,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{},"possiblySensitive":false,"pinnedTweetIds":["1845902392635936949"],"profile_bio":{"description":"#base 1st media & community 🟦 Daily alphas & insights on Base. Collab: https://t.co/klyCTi0j2X\n@BasedAlliance_ help projects gtm, launch & scale on base long term","entities":{"description":{"has